    "html": "<p>A mass–spring system oscillates vertically with a period of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span> at the surface of the Earth. The gravitational field strength at the surface of Mars is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.3 g\"></span>. What is the period of the same mass–spring system on the surface of Mars?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.9T\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.3T\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3T\"></span></li></ol>"
